{"overview":"آشیتاکا، پادشاهی از مردم امیشی که در حال ناپدید شدن هستند، توسط خدای خرس شیطانی نفرین می‌شود و باید به غرب سفر کند تا درمانی پیدا کند. در مسیر، او با سان، یک زن جوان انسانی که برای حفاظت از جنگل مبارزه می‌کند، و لیدی ابوشی، که سعی در تخریب آن دارد، روبه‌رو می‌شود. آشیتاکا باید راهی برای برقراری تعادل در این درگیری پیدا کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ashitaka, a prince of the disappearing Emishi people, is cursed by a demonized boar god and must journey to the west to find a cure. Along the way, he encounters San, a young human woman fighting to protect the forest, and Lady Eboshi, who is trying to destroy it. Ashitaka must find a way to bring balance to this conflict.","tagline_en":"The fate of the world rests on the courage of one warrior.","runtime":134,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["هایائو میازاکی"],"crew_en":["Hayao Miyazaki"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"松田洋治","role":"Ashitaka (voice)","photo":"/42WeHwCymsgJh3mLAyknCdRcef8.jpg","en":"Yoji Matsuda"},{"name":"石田ゆり子","role":"San / Kaya (voice)","photo":"/cADoBCi603Chz2IaxcwWT2mNwCf.jpg","en":"Yuriko Ishida"},{"name":"یوکو تاناکا","role":"Eboshi Gozen (voice)","photo":"/fMonAnp3OQ16FmGy5SGhEJRcuVI.jpg","en":"Yuko Tanaka"},{"name":"ساکوراکو کوبایاشی","role":"Jikobo (voice)","photo":"/pJSt6nRgcIsli0hw2aOCzc2l622.jpg","en":"Kaoru Kobayashi"},{"name":"西村雅彥","role":"Kouroku (voice)","photo":"/qk7nO5RWFr2f3VeJNpf7sgsbsXR.jpg","en":"Masahiko Nishimura"},{"name":"上條恒彦","role":"Gonza (voice)","photo":"/v2poQi0qYEWdTaMf2pVTWmcdwZp.jpg","en":"Tsunehiko Kamijô"},{"name":"آکیهیرو میوا","role":"Mrs. Moro (voice)","photo":"/20n18waqgVo5zSO6Ot0d4fz3jAM.jpg","en":"Akihiro Miwa"},{"name":"森光子","role":"Mrs. Hii (voice)","photo":"/x9LpdNvssR13XRyP5P3jwrQmg4s.jpg","en":"Mitsuko Mori"},{"name":"森繁久彌","role":"Chief of Affairs (voice)","photo":"/nqoBCC0RRSVPDOfjfIU4ipZ7hQT.jpg","en":"Hisaya Morishige"},{"name":"島本須美","role":"Toki (voice)","photo":"/iKIDv2VFpAgzJ0uMQi7pzcMHB9i.jpg","en":"Su